  "description": "Flyway C Rival XPLR SUS is a serious contender for the title of Most Comfortable Gravel Bike. Its carbon fiber frame features our Class 5 VRS™ frame design for cushion on rough roads, and a 40mm RockShox Rudy fork soaks up impacts for a seriously capable ride over the most challenging gravel. Flyway’s riding position finds a fine balance between all-out race rig and all-day wanderer. And whether you’re chasing a podium spot or a really good time, Flyway’s cargo mounts make it easy to fine-tune your loadout. SRAM’s Rival XPLR drivetrain is a reliable performer with the gear range to get you over the steepest climbs and capitalize on the stiffest tailwinds.",
